WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Paste a video link, choose a quality, and save the video to your device.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:11.000
Select a creator’s collection and download the videos together.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Save watch history, liked videos, and playlists from supported accounts.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Filter by date, quality, or regular expression. Customize filenames.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.500
Set up encrypted DNS and proxies. Anonymous mode hides sensitive details on screen.

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:29.000
Tor can route supported connections through the Tor network.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:33.500
SNI fragmentation depends on the platform and network. Destination IP addresses can remain visible.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:36.500
Select the HTTP version, browser identity, and network interface.

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:39.650
Set download concurrency, worker counts, and speed limits.

00:00:39.650 --> 00:00:40.000
Paste a link to get started.

